    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc033_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我还担心路上会堵车。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc033_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "今天周六，早上还不算太堵。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc033_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我们的车是几点？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc033_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "九点二十。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc033_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "先找检票口吧。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc033_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "不用急，信息还没出来。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc033_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那我们先坐一会儿。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc033_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你第一次自己从这里坐火车吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc033_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "不是第一次坐火车，但是以前有人带我。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc033_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "今天你可以自己看流程。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc033_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "进站、检票、找站台，对吧？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc033_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，很简单。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc033_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我现在已经没那么紧张了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc033_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你看，检票信息出来了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc033_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我们现在过去吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc033_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
